+# Maintainer: Timofei Granovskii <t.stifix@gmail.com>
+# HWC runs as the host UID with the Android system group. Keep creation of
+# /dev/input in init so HWC needs neither root nor CAP_CHOWN.
+on init
+    mkdir /dev/input 0770 system system
+    restorecon /dev/input
